error[E0063]: `Int` does not satisfy `json::ToJson`
  --> tests/ui/08-interfaces/bounds/bound_unsatisfied_in_other_module/src/main.cheby:14:31
   |
14 |   io::println(json::to_string(box::to_json(box::of(1))))
   |                               ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ required by a bound of `to_json`
   |
   = note: `Int` gets its functions from `std::int`, which has no function `to_json(Int) -> json::Value` (§8.2, D-447)

